PastePal is derived from Flycut, an open-source clipboard manager originally
developed by General Arcade, and from Jumpcut, the project Flycut was forked
from.

Upstream projects:
- Flycut: https://github.com/TermiT/Flycut
- Jumpcut: http://jumpcut.sourceforge.net

Flycut copyright (C) 2011 General Arcade, Gennadiy Potapov.
Jumpcut copyright (C) 2002-2008 Steve Cook.

Both upstream projects are distributed under the MIT License. The original
Flycut copyright and permission notice is preserved in the LICENSE file.

PastePal's macOS-only migration, image clipboard support, branding, and
release automation are maintained independently in this repository.
